<template><section><el-tabs v-model="tab"><el-tab-pane label="入职申请与结果" name="records"><div class="toolbar"><el-input v-model="search" clearable placeholder="搜索姓名或门店" style="max-width:300px"/><el-button @click="load">刷新</el-button></div><el-table :data="filtered"><el-table-column prop="name" label="员工"/><el-table-column prop="store_name" label="归属门店" min-width="180"/><el-table-column label="状态"><template #default="{row}">{{labels[row.status]}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="申请时间" min-width="165"><template #default="{row}">{{time(row.created_at)}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column prop="entry_date" label="入职日期"/><el-table-column label="确认店长"><template #default="{row}">{{row.confirmed_by_name||'—'}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="日期状态"><template #default="{row}">{{row.date_locked?'已锁定':'待店长确认'}}</template></el-table-column></el-table><p>扫码提交会自动生成待入职档案；确认在小程序由本店店长办理，无需总部审批。确认后入职日期锁定。</p></el-tab-pane><el-tab-pane v-if="canConfigure" label="入职通知接收人" name="config"><el-form label-position="top" style="max-width:680px"><el-form-item label="额外通知人员（如人事、财务）"><el-select v-model="config.user_ids" multiple filterable style="width:100%"><el-option v-for="u in config.users" :key="u.id" :value="u.id" :label="u.name"/></el-select></el-form-item><el-form-item label="额外通知岗位"><el-select v-model="config.position_ids" multiple filterable style="width:100%"><el-option v-for="p in config.positions" :key="p.id" :value="p.id" :label="p.name"/></el-select></el-form-item><p>本店店长、新员工本人及总部管理员默认收到通知；按岗位接收时继续限制其负责门店。这里只配置通知，不增加审批环节。</p><el-button type="primary" :loading="busy" @click="save">保存通知配置</el-button></el-form></el-tab-pane></el-tabs><el-alert v-if="error" :title="error" type="error" :closable="false"/></section></template>
<script setup>
import {ref,computed,onMounted} from 'vue';import {ElMessage} from 'element-plus';import {storeOperationsApi as api} from '@/api';const props=defineProps({canConfigure:Boolean}),rows=ref([]),config=ref({revision:0,user_ids:[],position_ids:[],users:[],positions:[]}),tab=ref('records'),search=ref(''),busy=ref(false),error=ref(''),labels={pending:'待店长确认',confirmed:'已入职',rejected:'未通过'},time=v=>v?new Date(v).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{hour12:false}):'—',filtered=computed(()=>rows.value.filter(r=>(r.name+' '+r.store_name).includes(search.value.trim())));
async function load(){try{rows.value=(await api.onboardingRecords()).rows;if(props.canConfigure)config.value=await api.onboardingConfig();error.value=''}catch(e){error.value=e.message}}
async function save(){if(busy.value)return;busy.value=true;try{await api.saveOnboardingConfig(config.value);await load();ElMessage.success('入职通知配置已保存')}catch(e){error.value=e.message}finally{busy.value=false}}onMounted(load);
</script>
<style scoped>.toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin:18px 0}p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:#87939e;margin:18px 0}</style>
